From: arthur <arthur.miller@live.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 05:16:48 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 12/13] Add float-printing tests

tests/float-print.pure.lisp: shortest digits against an exact rational
reference, layout of PRIN1 output, fixed-position digits and FORMAT
float directives against expected output, the FORMAT transform against
FORMAT interpreting the same string, and the portable digit routine
against the VOP.
---
