+;;;; Tests of float printing: PRIN1 and friends (shortest round-trip digits,
+;;;; via zmij in src/code/zmij.lisp) and the FORMAT float directives ~F, ~E,
+;;;; ~G and ~$ (fixed-precision digits in src/code/print.lisp).
+
+;;;; This software is part of the SBCL system. See the README file for
+;;;; more information.
+;;;;
+;;;; While most of SBCL is derived from the CMU CL system, the test
+;;;; files (like this one) were written from scratch after the fork
+;;;; from CMU CL.
